div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">Schedule a meeting with me: <a href=\"https://calendly.com/tobyhodges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://calendly.com/tobyhodges&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246269942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34S8IgSm0YJqsApCfIsq6F\">https://calendly.com/tobyhodges</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border-right:none rgba(0,0,0,0.15);border-bottom:none rgba(0,0,0,0.15);border-left:none rgba(0,0,0,0.15);border-top:1pt solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);padding:5pt 0cm 0cm;margin-top:7.5pt\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-left:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">This list is for the purpose of general discussion about The Carpentries including community activities, upcoming events, and announcements. Some other lists you may also be interested in include discuss-hpc, discuss-r,\r\n and our local groups. Visit <a href=\"https